----------------------- Actions ------------------------
  c confirm   t assign   s split   d discard   b break
  y confirm all   ? help   q quit

------------------------- Help -------------------------
  Assign
    t <block> <ticket>
      Assign a block to a ticket
    u <block> <n>
      Take suggestion <n>
    r [repo]
      Remember last assignment
  Confirm
    c <block>
      Confirm a block
    y
      Confirm all assigned blocks
  Adjust
    s <block> <time> [<ticket>]
      Split a block at a time
    b <block>
      Mark a block as a break
    d <block>
      Discard a block
  Other
    a
      Acknowledge daily cap
    q
      Quit
    ?
      Show this help (also: help)

  Placeholders
    <block>   number from the # column
    <ticket>  ticket key, e.g. ABC-12
    <time>    time of day, HH:MM
    <n>       suggestion number
    [repo]    optional: whole repository
